d by the upcoming real-world building of Alliance Fran\u00e7aise Vancouver, Espace V is the permanent cultural gallery in the virtual world. \nWe invite you to explore the modern space, socialize with other users, admire 2D art, photography, and dive into curated award-winning VR pieces of local and international artists.", "short_description": "Welcome to Espace V! The immersive space to connect, experience, and engage with Francophone cultures in a variety of digital media forms.\nInspired by the upcoming real-world building of Alliance Fran\u00e7aise Vancouver, Espace V is the permanent cultural gallery in the virtual world. \nWe invite you to explore the modern space, socialize with other users, admire 2D art, photography, and dive into curated award-winning VR pieces of local and international artists."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.kre.is/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kreis Experiences Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.kre.is/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "ART_CREATIVITY", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6930872900287141"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031412_617232836333967_3232330247506139